#====================================================================
# name: trailing-comma line continuation on a paren-less bareword call [ghi]
# Same rule applies to bareword-command calls — `puts 'a',\n\t'b'` reads
# the same as `puts 'a', 'b'`.
#

#--- code -----------------------------------------------------------
puts 'a',
	'b',
	'c'
